 feel, while hardwood flooring and central A/C add everyday comfort. The thoughtfully designed main floor features a spacious formal dining room, convenient laundry, and a stunning kitchen complete with granite countertops, a large island with seating for 4-5, gas cooktop, and built-in wall oven. The luxurious primary retreat offers a two-way fireplace and a spa-inspired ensuite with a corner soaker tub and separate shower. A second bedroom and full bath complete the main level. Downstairs you’ll find an expansive family room, a 3-piece bath, den that could be converted to a bedroom by adding an egress window, and an impressive storage room. An insulated attached double garage completes this exceptional home. (id:67522)","facts":[["Price","$589,000"],["Type","House"],["Style","Bungalow"],["Bedrooms","2"],["Bathrooms","3"],["Living area","1,477 sq ft"],["Lot size","6,240 sq ft"],["Year built","2000"],["Storeys","1"],["Neighbourhood","Deer Park"],["Town","Spruce Grove"],["Postal code","T7X4B1"],["MLS® number","E4515482"],["Listed","November 5, 2026"]],"features":[["Appliances","Washer, Refrigerator, Dishwasher, Stove, Dryer, Oven - Built-In, Hood Fan, Storage Shed, Window Coverings, Garage door opener"],["Heating","Forced air"],["Cooling","Central air conditioning"],["Fireplace","Gas"],["Basement","Finished, Full"],["Parking","Attached Garage"]],"rooms":[["Living room","Main level","3.70m"],["Dining room","Main level","2.76m"],["Kitchen","Main level","2.92m"],["Family room","Lower level","6.38m"],["Den","Lower level","3.15m"],["Primary Bedroom","Main level","3.35m"],["Bedroom 2","Main level","2.85m"]],"courtesy":"Matthew Roth, RE/MAX PREFERRED CHOICE","board":"REALTORS® Association of Edmonton","town_slug":"spruce-grove","hood_slug":"deer-park","area":""}